DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
19545::$$$message_0188_0000_0000$$$::"Let's go on a retreat."::
19546::$$$message_0188_0000_0001$$$::"..."::
19547::$$$message_0188_0000_0002$$$::"..."::
19548::$$$message_0188_0000_0003$$$::"...I thought you'd react more, not freeze like the old TV in the lobby.[lr]::
19549::$$$message_0188_0000_0004$$$::Is it time to buy another one, Lancer?"::
19550::$$$message_0188_0000_0005$$$::"Nah, I just froze up because I couldn't decide on a comeback."::
19551::$$$message_0188_0000_0006$$$::"What spurred the sudden change of heart from our slave driver?"::
19552::$$$message_0188_0000_0007$$$::"Mm. Was it strange of me to offer?"::
19553::$$$message_0188_0000_0008$$$::"Yeah; [hfchance layer=1]zero preamble, [wm canskip=0][wait canskip=0 time=100][hfchance layer=1]zero context, [wm canskip=0][wait canskip=0 time=100][hfchance layer=1]and zero sincerity.[wm canskip=0][wait canskip=0 time=100][hffacechg chara=アロハランサー face=呆れ layer=1 time=300] That's why I can't believe you're trying to act like a boxer (sister)."::
19554::$$$message_0188_0000_0009$$$::"You think so too, right?[lr]::
19555::$$$message_0188_0000_0010$$$::It's a pretty odd thing to hear from our black-hearted Master."::
19556::$$$message_0188_0000_0011$$$::"...Do you agree, Archer?"::
19557::$$$message_0188_0000_0012$$$::"Mmm... While this is hardly the first time you've behaved strangely, Caren, this proposal does seem out of character."::
19558::$$$message_0188_0000_0013$$$::"After all, both the TV in the lobby and Lancer will function if you give them a good smack."::
19559::$$$message_0188_0000_0014$$$::"...I see. Insightful as ever, Archer."::
19560::$$$message_0188_0000_0015$$$::"We should indeed wait to replace faulty equipment until after it fails. It would be greedy to buy a new appliance before the old one has broken."::
19561::$$$message_0188_0000_0016$$$::"If anyone here is broken, it's obviously you."::
19562::$$$message_0188_0000_0017$$$::"There's the Caren we all know."::
19563::$$$message_0188_0000_0018$$$::"Sorry, what were we talking about again? Something about excreting in each other's company?"::
19564::$$$message_0188_0000_0019$$$::"...Sorry, Caren. I know you're into that stuff, but it's not really up my alley."[nolr]::
19565::$$$message_0188_0000_0020$$$::"Do you want to die?"[rf][nolr]::
19566::$$$message_0188_0000_0021$$$::"Aw, don't be like that. Your poor sense of humor is one of your flaws. Even if I was being dead serious."::
19567::$$$message_0188_0000_0022$$$::"That sounds like something Avenger might be interested in, so try asking him if you're looking for company."::
19568::$$$message_0188_0000_0023$$$::"(...)"::
19569::$$$message_0188_0000_0024$$$::"[font italic=true]That's[font italic=false] what makes you blush? What a bad joke... [wait canskip=0 time=400][hffacechg chara=アロハランサー face=楽 layer=1 time=200][hfwww layer=1]So, what's this company retreat? We going to an onsen resort in the mountains?"::
19570::$$$message_0188_0000_0025$$$::"Oh, you've heard of it, Lancer?[lr]::
19571::$$$message_0188_0000_0026$$$::Did someone mention it to you?"::
19572::$$$message_0188_0000_0027$$$::"A little. I heard something like that going around earlier. The first person to get in the bath gets their wish granted, or whatever."::
19573::$$$message_0188_0000_0028$$$::"That sounds awfully impressive..."[lr]::
19574::$$$message_0188_0000_0029$$$::"Wait, you actually have a wish, Caren!?"::
19575::$$$message_0188_0000_0030$$$::"Not particularly. The world is full of misfortune.[lr]::
19576::$$$message_0188_0000_0031$$$::I personally feel fulfilled, so there is nothing more that I would wish for."::
19577::$$$message_0188_0000_0032$$$::"Huh? Then what's the point in going?"::
19578::$$$message_0188_0000_0033$$$::"I said it would be a retreat. A vacation.[lr]::
19579::$$$message_0188_0000_0034$$$::You two have as much of a right to it as I do."::
19580::$$$message_0188_0000_0035$$$::"...Oi.[lr]::
19581::$$$message_0188_0000_0036$$$::What'd you do to get her so hacked off?"::
19582::$$$message_0188_0000_0037$$$::"Nothing comes to mind. It must have been some blunder of yours. Like that one time you didn't make her an omelet for breakfast."::
19583::$$$message_0188_0000_0038$$$::"How rude. Do I strike you as the petty sort?"::
19584::$$$message_0188_0000_0039$$$::"The truth is, this morning I buried a small animal which had been run over by a car."::
19585::$$$message_0188_0001_0000$$$::"While I did so, it occurred to me that you two deserve a reward."::
19586::$$$message_0188_0001_0001$$$::"Bollocks."::
19587::$$$message_0188_0001_0002$$$::"Who thinks of [font italic=true]vacations[font italic=false] at a time like that?"::
19588::$$$message_0188_0001_0003$$$::"...[lr]::
19589::$$$message_0188_0001_0004$$$::So, will you be coming?"::
19590::$$$message_0188_0001_0005$$$::"Sure, I'll bite.[lr]::
19591::$$$message_0188_0001_0006$$$::Insane as the source of it might be, I appreciate the thought."::
19592::$$$message_0188_0001_0007$$$::"True. I doubt we'll ever get another chance to take a vacation again."::
19593::$$$message_0188_0001_0008$$$::"All right! If it's happening, we'd better get ready. Hey, kid, don't forget your Noble Phantasm. I have a feeling we're going to run into a lot of troublemakers."::
19594::$$$message_0188_0001_0009$$$::"Aw, shucks. Make sure you don't accidentally bring a laundry pole with you instead, Lancer."[nolr]::
19595::$$$message_0188_0002_0000$$$::"...Hehe. You're all so eager.[lr]::
19596::$$$message_0188_0002_0001$$$::I'm happy to see this look on your faces, even if you were tricked into it."::
19597::$$$message_0188_0002_0002$$$::"Yes, let us enjoy this day to the fullest."::
19598::$$$message_0188_0002_0003$$$::"Now... [wait canskip=0 time=800][hfstamp layer=0]Scurry forth in the name of my desires, you pitiful dogs."}ZY�